Version 8.1.4

*  [Bryan Christ] Settings dialog: less repeated code, same behaviour.
   (TODO S3)

   -  The five small popups (error, warning, saved, discard, save)
      each had their own copy of the same close routine, and the three
      notices their own copy of the same key handler.  One popup_close
      and one notice_popup_kmio serve them all.
   -  The two confirmations ("Discard / Cancel", "Save / Cancel")
      share one two-button key handler, which takes what the first
